(text "Carga por el USB-C del TP4056 (IN+/IN- son su conector)." (at 12.7 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7b277fdd-2b23-458c-9840-c14110503836))
(text "D4 es el diodo del elevador y bloquea el retorno del USB del DevKit." (at 12.7 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2d2e4753-5999-48bc-9ec1-479799a1e48d))
(text "R13/R14: 4.2 V de bateria -> 2.1 V en GPIO10 (ADC1)." (at 12.7 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 75b4d672-000d-446a-93b8-89bece16dc68))
(text "Consumo estimado ~400 mA de bateria. 2 x 3000 mAh" (at 12.7 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 01604cfe-ee30-46fd-8bc6-efb5fcb8505b))
(text "nominales dan unas 10 h, el doble de las 5 h pedidas." (at 12.7 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 160cc4ab-8f06-4263-bdb1-8b9fa9cf4484))
(text "MT3608: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R15/R16) = 5.2 V en el riel, con FB despues de D4." (at 12.7 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 1e5fdedc-499f-468b-b658-0a7e5a59fe1e))
(text "EN a VIN. L1 con corriente de saturacion de 3 A o mas." (at 12.7 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 4757f3a3-d996-43f2-bdc0-4414fc86f634))
